Gunakan:

- Kotlin
- Jetpack Compose
- Material 3
- MVVM
- Clean Architecture
- Repository Pattern
- Kotlin Coroutines
- Kotlin Flow
- Firebase Authentication
- Firebase Realtime Database atau Cloud Firestore
- Firebase Cloud Messaging
- Android DataStore
- Android Keystore / encrypted storage
- Android official APIs
- WorkManager untuk sinkronisasi terjadwal
- QR Code scanner/generator
- FCM untuk push notification

Buat project production-ready dan modular.

