14. CONTACTS

Buat fitur:

CONTACTS

Gunakan Android Contacts Provider hanya setelah permission "READ_CONTACTS" diberikan.

Saat pertama kali fitur digunakan:

Tampilkan:

"Allow CONTROL PANEL to access contacts so they can be shared with your connected Parent account."

Permission:

Granted / Denied

Jika Granted:

Baca contact yang diperlukan.

Data:

- Contact ID
- Name
- Phone number
- Email
- Photo URI jika tersedia

Sinkronkan ke:

"contacts/{deviceId}/{contactId}"

Fitur:

- Sync Contacts
- Sync Now
- Last Sync
- Contact count
- Permission status

Jika permission dicabut:

- stop synchronization
- update permission status Firebase

Jangan membaca kontak tanpa permission.

